  "bio": "Experience the fusion of tradition and innovation at David Rogerson’s ACE TATTOO, the esteemed cornerstone of East Bay's tattoo culture. Specializing in the intricate artistry of Japanese, bold contrasts of Trash Polka, and meticulous lettering, your ink dreams are realized with unrivaled precision. Connect with us at 11375 San Pablo Ave, El Cerrito, CA for a consultation or text 510-233-1979 to embark on your next masterpiece.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: El Cerrito, California, United States\n\nACE TATTOO East Bay's oldest shop\nText 5102331979 w serious inquires for the finest work.Better yet, come to 11375 San Pablo Ave, El Cerrito, CA 94530",
